# Normalize text to LF in the repository and on checkout, on every platform.
# gofmt and gofumpt emit LF, so a CRLF checkout makes every Go file read as
# unformatted and `mise run format:check` fails for reasons that have nothing
# to do with formatting. text=auto detects binary files on its own.
#
# A file that genuinely requires CRLF (a .bat or .cmd script) needs its own
# `eol=crlf` line; nothing in the repository does today.
* text=auto eol=lf
